language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario ReplacePresentation.
condition ReplacePresentationReady.
condition ReplacePresentationContinue.
condition ReplacePresentationReject.
outcome ReplacePresentationCompleted.
outcome ReplacePresentationRejected.
step ReplacePresentationPrepare.
step ReplacePresentationValidate.
step ReplacePresentationPublish.
step ReplacePresentationReconcile.
step ReplacePresentationObserve.
step ReplacePresentationFailure.
step ReplacePresentationSuccess.

condition ReplacementRevisionCurrent.
condition ReplacementRevisionStale.
condition RendererFailedAfterPublication.
outcome PriorPresentationRetained.
outcome PublishedButNotDisplayed.
step RejectStalePresentation.
step ReportRendererFailure.

ReplacePresentation illustrates ChangeUiPresentation.
ReplacePresentation exercises ReplaceablePresentation.
ReplacePresentation starts-when ReplacePresentationReady.
ReplacePresentation starts-at ReplacePresentationPrepare.
ReplacePresentationReady describes "A valid schema A and live Composition exist; candidate B is requested.".
ReplacePresentationContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
ReplacePresentationReject describes "Candidate preparation/binding validation or final observation fails outside the separately modeled stale-revision and post-publication renderer-failure paths.".
ReplacePresentationCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
ReplacePresentationRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
ReplacePresentation preserves PreserveRepresentationIdentity.
ReplacePresentation preserves UiResponsiveness.
ReplacePresentation preserves StableCommandIdentity.
ReplacePresentationPrepare calls BuildPresentationSchema within BuckingUI.
ReplacePresentationPrepare describes "Build B against identified Composition structural revision.".
ReplacePresentationPrepare proceeds-to ReplacePresentationFailure when ReplacePresentationReject.
ReplacePresentationPrepare proceeds-to ReplacePresentationValidate when ReplacePresentationContinue.
ReplacePresentationValidate calls ValidatePresentationBindings within BuckingUI.
ReplacePresentationValidate describes "Validate target types/kinds/capabilities and bindings.".
ReplacePresentationValidate proceeds-to ReplacePresentationFailure when ReplacePresentationReject.
ReplacePresentationValidate proceeds-to ReplacePresentationPublish when ReplacePresentationContinue.
ReplacePresentationPublish calls PublishPresentationRevision within BuckingUI.
ReplacePresentationPublish describes "Recheck relevant revision at commit, reject stale candidate under proposed policy.".
ReplacePresentationPublish proceeds-to ReplacePresentationFailure when ReplacePresentationReject.
ReplacePresentationPublish proceeds-to ReplacePresentationReconcile when ReplacementRevisionCurrent.
ReplacePresentationReconcile calls ReconcileViewNodes within BuckingUI.
ReplacePresentationReconcile describes "Renderer adapter reconciles against published B; logical app context, not Go-host placement.".
ReplacePresentationReconcile proceeds-to ReplacePresentationObserve when ReplacePresentationContinue.
ReplacePresentationObserve calls ObserveRenderedRevision within BuckingUI.
ReplacePresentationObserve describes "Only actual render observation establishes displayed B.".
ReplacePresentationObserve proceeds-to ReplacePresentationFailure when ReplacePresentationReject.
ReplacePresentationObserve proceeds-to ReplacePresentationSuccess when ReplacePresentationContinue.
ReplacePresentationFailure finishes ReplacePresentation with ReplacePresentationRejected.
ReplacePresentationSuccess finishes ReplacePresentation with ReplacePresentationCompleted.
ReplacePresentationPublish emits PresentationUpdates through OperatorPresentationChannel.
ReplacePresentation runs-alongside InspectMachine.
ReplacementRevisionCurrent describes "The Composition structural revision still matches the validated candidate at the atomic publication point.".
ReplacementRevisionStale describes "That relevant structural revision changed before publication; this exercise proposes reject-and-retain, not automatic retry.".
RendererFailedAfterPublication describes "Schema B was published but the renderer failed to materialize it; no automatic rollback is claimed.".
ReplacePresentationPublish proceeds-to RejectStalePresentation when ReplacementRevisionStale.
RejectStalePresentation finishes ReplacePresentation with PriorPresentationRetained.
ReplacePresentationReconcile proceeds-to ReportRendererFailure when RendererFailedAfterPublication.
ReportRendererFailure finishes ReplacePresentation with PublishedButNotDisplayed.
PriorPresentationRetained describes "Candidate was not published; prior valid schema A and semantic identities remain active.".
PublishedButNotDisplayed describes "Published revision and displayed revision differ; recovery policy remains RendererFailureGap.".
